{%- comment -%}
  Prüv custom cursor: copper dot + trailing ring.

  Markup is server-rendered rather than JS-injected so it exists at first
  paint. Styles live in assets/pruv-custom-cursor.css and behavior in
  assets/pruv-custom-cursor.js - keep them there rather than inlining copies
  here, so there is a single source of truth for this component.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="pruv-cursor-dot" id="PruvCursorDot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="pruv-cursor-ring" id="PruvCursorRing" aria-hidden="true"></div>
